{"seq":2,"slug":"factor-construction","title":"因子构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"factor-definition","title":"因子定义与计算方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-definition","wordCount":2516,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"factor-testing","title":"因子检验与统计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-testing","wordCount":2114,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-decay","title":"因子衰减与半衰期分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/factor-construction/factor-decay","wordCount":2229,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"因子构建\">因子构建</h1><p>本章聚焦因子从概念到可交易信号的工程化过程。第一篇详解因子定义的技术细节——如何从原始数据计算因子值、如何处理异常值和缺失值、如何构建因子模拟组合。第二篇深入因子检验的统计方法——截面回归、IC 分析、分组回测和稳健性检验。第三篇讨论因子衰减——信号的有效期多长、半衰期如何估计、如何据此制定再平衡策略。三篇文档覆盖&quot;发现一个因子 → 验证一个因子 → 理解因子生命周期&quot;的完整流程。</p>\n"}